      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The L12 precipitates will act as dislocation-transmission bridges across lamellar interfaces.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The L12 precipitates will act as dislocation-absorption sites at lamellar interfaces.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "L12 precipitation facilitates dislocation bowing or bypass and thereby contributes to strengthening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6478865::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed interfacial L12 precipitates will mitigate dislocation pile-ups and local stress concentrations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mitigating pile-ups and stress concentrations will suppress microcrack nucleation and catastrophic damage during straining.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The aging treatment will retain or modestly increase yield strength relative to the untreated alloy.",
